<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank sets 13-wk T-bill auction at 11.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank sets 13-wk T-bill auction at 11.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank has set an auction offering six billion crowns in 13-week treasury bills for Wednesday, the central bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Limit price on bids in the American-style auction has been set at a minimum of 971,750 crowns for the bills with a nominal value of one million crowns, equalling a maximum yield of 11.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
